(841156, 94351, 22385, '<td valign="top">Very creative!  I think the inclusion of the faucet is a good thing and a bad thing.  On the plus side, it emphasizes the miniature aspect of the photo.  On the negative side, it''s not exactly visually appealing.  Nevertheless, I gave the image a 7.</td>', 'Very creative!  I think the inclusion of the faucet is a good thing and a bad thing.  On the plus side, it emphasizes the miniature aspect of the photo.  On the negative side, it''s not exactly visually appealing.  Nevertheless, I gave the image a 7.', '2004-08-04 02:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(841159, 95517, 16241, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2004-08-04 02:48:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(841161, 95489, 22385, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... overall, I like this photo.  I wouldn''t want it framed in my apartment, but I like the creativity behind the image!  I think the inclusion of the keyboard hurts the appeal of your photo.  There are other perspectives that you could use to make this photo even better.  But I like your creativity - and it has reasonably good focus and lighting.  I give it a 7!</td>', 'Hmmm... overall, I like this photo.  I wouldn''t want it framed in my apartment, but I like the creativity behind the image!  I think the inclusion of the keyboard hurts the appeal of your photo.  There are other perspectives that you could use to make this photo even better.  But I like your creativity - and it has reasonably good focus and lighting.  I give it a 7!', '2004-08-04 02:49:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(841164, 95626, 24909, '<td valign="top">What a big train!</td>', 'What a big train!', '2004-08-04 02:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(841166, 95629, 24909, '<td valign="top">Nice violin miniature!</td>', 'Nice violin miniature!', '2004-08-04 02:52:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(841169, 95575, 24909, '<td valign="top">Great ball!</td>', 'Great ball!', '2004-08-04 02:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(841170, 95595, 22385, '<td valign="top">This photo has a lot of potential.  I really like the concept behind it.  What detracts from the concept, however, is the poor lighting and focus.  I think if you try some more angles and play with the lighting and focus, you could have a ribbon winner, here.</td>', 'This photo has a lot of potential.  I really like the concept behind it.  What detracts from the concept, however, is the poor lighting and focus.  I think if you try some more angles and play with the lighting and focus, you could have a ribbon winner, here.', '2004-08-04 02:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(841174, 94897, 22385, '<td valign="top">Poor lighting and focus.  Think about this: would you want this framed on your wall?  I''m not trying to hurt your feelings, but I''m sure you can produce better work than this particular photograph.</td>', 'Poor lighting and focus.  Think about this: would you want this framed on your wall?  I''m not trying to hurt your feelings, but I''m sure you can produce better work than this particular photograph.', '2004-08-04 02:55:15.000000', NULL, 1);
