(841441, 94495, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice use of shallow DOF to create real depth. Composition works well - particularly in terms of placement of diagonal sword and round sheild towards upper right third. 9</td>', 'Nice use of shallow DOF to create real depth. Composition works well - particularly in terms of placement of diagonal sword and round sheild towards upper right third. 9', '2004-08-04 06:04:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(841443, 95193, 3087, '<td valign="top">Isn''t it sad that so many soldiers gave their lives back then because they believed it would be the war to end all wars. What would they think of their descendants if they could see the world now? Nicely done with good composition, good attention to depth and good choice of toned black and white. 8</td>', 'Isn''t it sad that so many soldiers gave their lives back then because they believed it would be the war to end all wars. What would they think of their descendants if they could see the world now? Nicely done with good composition, good attention to depth and good choice of toned black and white. 8', '2004-08-04 06:07:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(841444, 95617, 3087, '<td valign="top">The muted colours of the gnome work well against the faded wood. The composition, with diagonal coming up ffrom same corner that is "weighted" by gnome is great, especially with verticals from fence. Like the shallow DOF. 9</td>', 'The muted colours of the gnome work well against the faded wood. The composition, with diagonal coming up ffrom same corner that is "weighted" by gnome is great, especially with verticals from fence. Like the shallow DOF. 9', '2004-08-04 06:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(841445, 95594, 3087, '<td valign="top">Like the simplicity of this image. Whilst the glass is for wine and the bottle contains whisky this doesn''t really matter as it''s more about the combination of two glass objects to show scale. The shadow on the lower right background is subtle and adds a touch of depth. The angle of the bottle in the glass provides a strong composition. I like the choice of sepia tone. I''d prefer slightly more diffused light to give softer edges to the hard white reflections on the bottle but wouldn''t want to lose them altogether as I think the image does need a touch more lighter tones overall. 9</td>', 'Like the simplicity of this image. Whilst the glass is for wine and the bottle contains whisky this doesn''t really matter as it''s more about the combination of two glass objects to show scale. The shadow on the lower right background is subtle and adds a touch of depth. The angle of the bottle in the glass provides a strong composition. I like the choice of sepia tone. I''d prefer slightly more diffused light to give softer edges to the hard white reflections on the bottle but wouldn''t want to lose them altogether as I think the image does need a touch more lighter tones overall. 9', '2004-08-04 06:11:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(841446, 95598, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice rotation and close crop works well. Seems quite pink to me (and I don''t think it''s my monitor calibration but would be willing to consider that it might be). 8</td>', 'Nice rotation and close crop works well. Seems quite pink to me (and I don''t think it''s my monitor calibration but would be willing to consider that it might be). 8', '2004-08-04 06:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(841447, 95619, 3087, '<td valign="top">Absolutely wonderful use of colour - I particularly like how the blue is at the bottom and the green at the top in a reversal of the familiar position of sky and grass in so many shots. Is the blue a napkin wrapped around the bowl? The vivid orange works superbly with the blue and green and I also notice how the miniature figuresd have the same blue in their clothes. Composition is superb as is DOF. One of my favourites. 10</td>', 'Absolutely wonderful use of colour - I particularly like how the blue is at the bottom and the green at the top in a reversal of the familiar position of sky and grass in so many shots. Is the blue a napkin wrapped around the bowl? The vivid orange works superbly with the blue and green and I also notice how the miniature figuresd have the same blue in their clothes. Composition is superb as is DOF. One of my favourites. 10', '2004-08-04 06:14:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(841448, 94195, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the surreal edge to this and could see this hanging in a national gallery exhibit. Wonderful composition with the light area at the top right absolutely essential to the balance. Did you eat the bun? 10</td>', 'Love the surreal edge to this and could see this hanging in a national gallery exhibit. Wonderful composition with the light area at the top right absolutely essential to the balance. Did you eat the bun? 10', '2004-08-04 06:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(841449, 95492, 3087, '<td valign="top">Simplicity is superb and aided greatly by expanse of clean white background and use of everyday biro to provide scale. Just the presence of that biro has me imaging this little house and flowers on someone''s desk - a momento of a special day or trip - a muse they look at when needing a mental break. Nicely composed. 9</td>', 'Simplicity is superb and aided greatly by expanse of clean white background and use of everyday biro to provide scale. Just the presence of that biro has me imaging this little house and flowers on someone''s desk - a momento of a special day or trip - a muse they look at when needing a mental break. Nicely composed. 9', '2004-08-04 06:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(841450, 95480, 3087, '<td valign="top">Love the use of the yellow line to add such strong colour and to add perspective too. Addition of lights in black sky really makes this toy car picture more complete than the rest. Nice composition too. 9</td>', 'Love the use of the yellow line to add such strong colour and to add perspective too. Addition of lights in black sky really makes this toy car picture more complete than the rest. Nice composition too. 9', '2004-08-04 06:17:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(841451, 94351, 3087, '<td valign="top">This just appeals because it''s so quirky. I like the black of the tap against the black of the matchstick man and the motion of the water too. 8</td>', 'This just appeals because it''s so quirky. I like the black of the tap against the black of the matchstick man and the motion of the water too. 8', '2004-08-04 06:17:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(841452, 95669, 3087, '<td valign="top">Perfect composition with miniature photo frame and toilet and also fold of toilet tissue on the flat surface. Great surreal feel. 9</td>', 'Perfect composition with miniature photo frame and toilet and also fold of toilet tissue on the flat surface. Great surreal feel. 9', '2004-08-04 06:18:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(841456, 95586, 3087, '<td valign="top">Beauitiful detail and presented so well. Composition works well with horizontal curves of the rim and lid against the more vertical curves of the strings. Colour and lighting work well, border is nicely done. 9</td>', 'Beauitiful detail and presented so well. Composition works well with horizontal curves of the rim and lid against the more vertical curves of the strings. Colour and lighting work well, border is nicely done. 9', '2004-08-04 06:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
