(841907, 95601, 3087, '<td valign="top">This shows the scale beautifully but too much of the cat is just a blur of motion to me. I like motion blur when it adds something to the image but here I think crisp focus would work better. I''d also suggest a plain background to eliminate all that detail behind the cat at the left of the frame. 6 but would have been higher with better focus and background.</td>', 'This shows the scale beautifully but too much of the cat is just a blur of motion to me. I like motion blur when it adds something to the image but here I think crisp focus would work better. I''d also suggest a plain background to eliminate all that detail behind the cat at the left of the frame. 6 but would have been higher with better focus and background.', '2004-08-04 11:43:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(841908, 94308, 23561, '<td valign="top">Excellent contrast. The mini tools make it look like the pot and strawberries and huge. My first thought was that you got the concept backwards (huge opposed to miniatures). A 10 for sure.</td>', 'Excellent contrast. The mini tools make it look like the pot and strawberries and huge. My first thought was that you got the concept backwards (huge opposed to miniatures). A 10 for sure.', '2004-08-04 11:43:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(841910, 94708, 23962, '<td valign="top">I''m trying to understand this pic in terms of the challenge subject. Even so, I can''t stop looking at it.</td>', 'I''m trying to understand this pic in terms of the challenge subject. Even so, I can''t stop looking at it.', '2004-08-04 11:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(841912, 95370, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nice idea of "cargo" to show scale but loses out because of poor background. The background is dirty and really shows reflections that have nothing to do with your image. This idea needs further development to make it more striking - what about non-plain backgrounds? 6</td>', 'Nice idea of "cargo" to show scale but loses out because of poor background. The background is dirty and really shows reflections that have nothing to do with your image. This idea needs further development to make it more striking - what about non-plain backgrounds? 6', '2004-08-04 11:46:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(841914, 95563, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the repetition of curves in the mould and griddle but the white curve at the top is cropped too much to add anything yet sufficiently obvious to detract. White surface is also dirty which is definitely not appealing. 6</td>', 'I like the repetition of curves in the mould and griddle but the white curve at the top is cropped too much to add anything yet sufficiently obvious to detract. White surface is also dirty which is definitely not appealing. 6', '2004-08-04 11:48:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(841918, 95495, 3087, '<td valign="top">Lighting is poor and focus seems soft. Nice idea in terms of showing scale. Because the middle dice sticks out to the left I think the pile would be better positioned towards lower right rather than lower left of the frame, with lighting correspondingly moved to throw shadows towards the left instead of the right. Alternatively reposition die so that middle one is towards right not left of white one. 6</td>', 'Lighting is poor and focus seems soft. Nice idea in terms of showing scale. Because the middle dice sticks out to the left I think the pile would be better positioned towards lower right rather than lower left of the frame, with lighting correspondingly moved to throw shadows towards the left instead of the right. Alternatively reposition die so that middle one is towards right not left of white one. 6', '2004-08-04 11:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(841921, 94985, 3087, '<td valign="top">A somewhat surreal image, not least because the tomatoes aren''t (or don''t appear to be) real. Nice use of shallow DOF. Not sure what they are sitting on but I think a plainer surface would work better here. 6</td>', 'A somewhat surreal image, not least because the tomatoes aren''t (or don''t appear to be) real. Nice use of shallow DOF. Not sure what they are sitting on but I think a plainer surface would work better here. 6', '2004-08-04 11:54:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(841922, 94466, 20771, '<td valign="top">Focus could be improved</td>', 'Focus could be improved', '2004-08-04 11:54:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(841923, 95704, 3087, '<td valign="top">Either needs to be properly vertical or rotated much more. As it stands it just appears to be accidentally tilted. Otherwise I quite like it. 6</td>', 'Either needs to be properly vertical or rotated much more. As it stands it just appears to be accidentally tilted. Otherwise I quite like it. 6', '2004-08-04 11:54:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(841924, 95442, 3087, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting but image seems to lack warmth or appeal. 6</td>', 'Interesting lighting but image seems to lack warmth or appeal. 6', '2004-08-04 11:55:07.000000', NULL, 1),
