(841931, 95699, 3087, '<td valign="top">This is an image full of sadness - the statue of "liberty" looking down on a street person who finds that his freedom comes with a dose of indifference from the rest of society. Although I can understand the reason for the use of negative space to amplify his solitude I am frustrated that I cannot see the detail that intrigues me. 7</td>', 'This is an image full of sadness - the statue of "liberty" looking down on a street person who finds that his freedom comes with a dose of indifference from the rest of society. Although I can understand the reason for the use of negative space to amplify his solitude I am frustrated that I cannot see the detail that intrigues me. 7', '2004-08-04 11:57:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(841933, 95600, 20771, '<td valign="top">Why sepia?</td>', 'Why sepia?', '2004-08-04 11:58:01.000000', NULL, 1),
