(842122, 95672, 9083, '<td valign="top">Focus could have been a little better maybe...... Great idea and lovely composition</td>', 'Focus could have been a little better maybe...... Great idea and lovely composition', '2004-08-04 12:58:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(842123, 95612, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cropped a little too tightly for my tastes. Also comes across as a picture of an object that fit the challenge with no creativity about how to show it, how to add interest above and beyond the appeal of the object itself. 6</td>', 'Cropped a little too tightly for my tastes. Also comes across as a picture of an object that fit the challenge with no creativity about how to show it, how to add interest above and beyond the appeal of the object itself. 6', '2004-08-04 12:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(842125, 95645, 3087, '<td valign="top">I''d rather see more of the interesting front bonnet of the large car than that messy area of the image towards top left. Nice idea though. 6</td>', 'I''d rather see more of the interesting front bonnet of the large car than that messy area of the image towards top left. Nice idea though. 6', '2004-08-04 12:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(842128, 95007, 9083, '<td valign="top">What amazing colours, shame the other people were in background, perfectly composed and bang on for meeting the challenge</td>', 'What amazing colours, shame the other people were in background, perfectly composed and bang on for meeting the challenge', '2004-08-04 12:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(842129, 95523, 24432, '<td valign="top">I was going to enter the same thing...It''s real..and a true subject...would have been perfect if the lighting around the bottom of the planter was gone.</td>', 'I was going to enter the same thing...It''s real..and a true subject...would have been perfect if the lighting around the bottom of the planter was gone.', '2004-08-04 13:00:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(842130, 94308, 24413, '<td valign="top">Great idea and photo!  One of my favorites!</td>', 'Great idea and photo!  One of my favorites!', '2004-08-04 13:00:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(842131, 95640, 3087, '<td valign="top">Shame that background image doesn''t extend further to the right as the large black area to the top right detracts quite a lot from the otherwise strong image. Great choice to go black and white. 7</td>', 'Shame that background image doesn''t extend further to the right as the large black area to the top right detracts quite a lot from the otherwise strong image. Great choice to go black and white. 7', '2004-08-04 13:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(842132, 95689, 2764, '<td valign="top">Cute - more attention to detail would have made it better.  take the black thing off her neck (her walkman head phones?) tilt the umbrella so it shows better. Focus on her face and let the background blur if it has to.  I think the focus problem might be camera shake, not DOF.  Try a tripod, or try metering on her face and keeping the shutter half depressed and recompose the shot.   Besides being out of focus, her face is too dark.  Since you want the background to look stromy, it would be ok to lighten her a little but not too much.  It looks like there are more interesting clouds right behind her head than the clouds you have chosen to show.  I love the concept and I love her expresiion and her upward glance. 7</td>', 'Cute - more attention to detail would have made it better.  take the black thing off her neck (her walkman head phones?) tilt the umbrella so it shows better. Focus on her face and let the background blur if it has to.  I think the focus problem might be camera shake, not DOF.  Try a tripod, or try metering on her face and keeping the shutter half depressed and recompose the shot.   Besides being out of focus, her face is too dark.  Since you want the background to look stromy, it would be ok to lighten her a little but not too much.  It looks like there are more interesting clouds right behind her head than the clouds you have chosen to show.  I love the concept and I love her expresiion and her upward glance. 7', '2004-08-04 13:00:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(842134, 95673, 9083, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting, superb composition, gonna be a winner 10</td>', 'Awesome lighting, superb composition, gonna be a winner 10', '2004-08-04 13:01:24.000000', NULL, 1),
