(842219, 94248, 3087, '<td valign="top">Well, I guess it''s a slightly smaller than average dragonfly but then most of them are reasonably small so it''s not an obvious miniature to me. Nice detail in the dragonfly itself and I like the way the wings make an angle that then works well in the top right corner of the frame. Although I can see it would look weird with much less finger because it''s so pink it kind of overpowers that little insect which I know is the idea for this challenge but means the finished image isn''t so interesting. 7</td>', 'Well, I guess it''s a slightly smaller than average dragonfly but then most of them are reasonably small so it''s not an obvious miniature to me. Nice detail in the dragonfly itself and I like the way the wings make an angle that then works well in the top right corner of the frame. Although I can see it would look weird with much less finger because it''s so pink it kind of overpowers that little insect which I know is the idea for this challenge but means the finished image isn''t so interesting. 7', '2004-08-04 13:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
