(842465, 95525, 7628, '<td valign="top">Dynamically precious!  Those blue eyes!  Those tiny claws!  And mama''s motherly proud look.  This must have been hard to set up - and yet you have not only a great subject (challenge or no challenge) but well composed, lit and focused.  This photo goes way beyond a "cat picture" and should draw lots of positive comments.  Good Luck!  10</td>', 'Dynamically precious!  Those blue eyes!  Those tiny claws!  And mama''s motherly proud look.  This must have been hard to set up - and yet you have not only a great subject (challenge or no challenge) but well composed, lit and focused.  This photo goes way beyond a "cat picture" and should draw lots of positive comments.  Good Luck!  10', '2004-08-04 15:42:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(842466, 95616, 22975, '<td valign="top">i like the reflection, but i think i would have cropped it a little differently... well, maybe not.  i kind of like the symmetry of the reflection in the bottle.  maybe i would have just layed it out a little differently, but what you did is nice.  i just wish it was a little more focused.</td>', 'i like the reflection, but i think i would have cropped it a little differently... well, maybe not.  i kind of like the symmetry of the reflection in the bottle.  maybe i would have just layed it out a little differently, but what you did is nice.  i just wish it was a little more focused.', '2004-08-04 15:42:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(842469, 95670, 22975, '<td valign="top">nice size comparison... i like the black and white, too.</td>', 'nice size comparison... i like the black and white, too.', '2004-08-04 15:43:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(842470, 95429, 22975, '<td valign="top">nice capture, i just wish the roses had a little more lighting (especially the small one).</td>', 'nice capture, i just wish the roses had a little more lighting (especially the small one).', '2004-08-04 15:44:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(842471, 95594, 22975, '<td valign="top">cute idea and it''s a nice shot, technically, too.</td>', 'cute idea and it''s a nice shot, technically, too.', '2004-08-04 15:44:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(842472, 95604, 7628, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  Good focus, good color.  The background is a bit pink - I''d like to see it white.  I''d also crop the left hand side all that white space just pulls the eye away I think.  You could ven crop so that nothing put the mouth of the bottle was showing - perhaps a bit drastic but I like the way it would look, cleaner and focused.</td>', 'Nice idea.  Good focus, good color.  The background is a bit pink - I''d like to see it white.  I''d also crop the left hand side all that white space just pulls the eye away I think.  You could ven crop so that nothing put the mouth of the bottle was showing - perhaps a bit drastic but I like the way it would look, cleaner and focused.', '2004-08-04 15:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(842474, 94552, 7628, '<td valign="top">I''m sure this is very small - but I''d liketo have some comparison to see just how small - a familiar background that gives some idea of scale or perhaps the corner of another familiar object - a regular die perhaps?  I like the detail I see in a tiny part of the top corner, but I wish you had a greater depth of field so the whole thing could be sharp, would work better for a metal object.</td>', 'I''m sure this is very small - but I''d liketo have some comparison to see just how small - a familiar background that gives some idea of scale or perhaps the corner of another familiar object - a regular die perhaps?  I like the detail I see in a tiny part of the top corner, but I wish you had a greater depth of field so the whole thing could be sharp, would work better for a metal object.', '2004-08-04 15:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(842494, 94879, 2764, '<td valign="top">I suppose you are going to get low marks because there isn''t anything miniature in your photo.  True.  But it is a wonderful image none the less.  Your picture tells a story.  We are driving out of a rain storm and into the sunlight.  But the oncoming cars are also coming out of the dark because they have their headlights on.  The wiper on our window has cleared a path - I say "our" window because of the intimate feel of the image.  I fell like I am inside the car.  The leading lines are interesting - the road leads out in front of us left to right, but the car driving towards us reveres it and brings it back.  The scene is divided rougly in thirds, an effective arrangement.  To top third is dark clouds and that is where the rain on the windshield is.  the middle third is the brighter future where the wipers have cleared the drops and the clouds are breaking up.  The bottom third is wet again, wet smears on the window, wet road.  Very well done photo for maybe the wrong challenge - 8</td>', 'I suppose you are going to get low marks because there isn''t anything miniature in your photo.  True.  But it is a wonderful image none the less.  Your picture tells a story.  We are driving out of a rain storm and into the sunlight.  But the oncoming cars are also coming out of the dark because they have their headlights on.  The wiper on our window has cleared a path - I say "our" window because of the intimate feel of the image.  I fell like I am inside the car.  The leading lines are interesting - the road leads out in front of us left to right, but the car driving towards us reveres it and brings it back.  The scene is divided rougly in thirds, an effective arrangement.  To top third is dark clouds and that is where the rain on the windshield is.  the middle third is the brighter future where the wipers have cleared the drops and the clouds are breaking up.  The bottom third is wet again, wet smears on the window, wet road.  Very well done photo for maybe the wrong challenge - 8', '2004-08-04 16:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
