(844595, 95653, 6845, '<td valign="top">Just because it is the way I normally present hand shots, I would really like to see this image in black and white. The lines and details just really seem to jump out at you when in black and white. I like the composition and the light, but I would like to see the little hand more in focus and the large hand a little softer. Just my opinion though. Good work.</td>', 'Just because it is the way I normally present hand shots, I would really like to see this image in black and white. The lines and details just really seem to jump out at you when in black and white. I like the composition and the light, but I would like to see the little hand more in focus and the large hand a little softer. Just my opinion though. Good work.', '2004-08-05 13:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(844597, 95424, 23561, '<td valign="top">Picture is a bit too dark and kind of boring.</td>', 'Picture is a bit too dark and kind of boring.', '2004-08-05 13:32:45.000000', NULL, 1),
