(844623, 95706, 6845, '<td valign="top">I like this one. For my personal taste I would have liked to have seen some more light kicked in to light up the front of the light house some more. I also would have liked to have seen the lighthouse closer to the fence for two reasons. One, so that the size of the light house was more evident and second, so that the lighthouse tower would fit better between the fence posts allowing better seperation between the tower and the fence.</td>', 'I like this one. For my personal taste I would have liked to have seen some more light kicked in to light up the front of the light house some more. I also would have liked to have seen the lighthouse closer to the fence for two reasons. One, so that the size of the light house was more evident and second, so that the lighthouse tower would fit better between the fence posts allowing better seperation between the tower and the fence.', '2004-08-05 13:41:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(844628, 95021, 23561, '<td valign="top">First thought was that it didn''t meet the challenge (I was looking for a miniature battery). On a second look I can see the different size flashlights so I guess it does meet the challenge. I think the picture is too busy. I don''t like the battery as the focal point. Maybe if the small blue flashlight was were the battery is...</td>', 'First thought was that it didn''t meet the challenge (I was looking for a miniature battery). On a second look I can see the different size flashlights so I guess it does meet the challenge. I think the picture is too busy. I don''t like the battery as the focal point. Maybe if the small blue flashlight was were the battery is...', '2004-08-05 13:43:47.000000', NULL, 1),
