(845474, 95550, 23394, '<td valign="top">forgive me for being dense, but i''m not sure how this meets the challenge.  even though it is a killer shot, it seems to be more of a macro shot than a miniature.</td>', 'forgive me for being dense, but i''m not sure how this meets the challenge.  even though it is a killer shot, it seems to be more of a macro shot than a miniature.', '2004-08-05 21:05:48.000000', NULL, 1),
