(845489, 95498, 23394, '<td valign="top">forgive me for being dense, but i''m not sure how this meets the challenge.  even though i see small change, this seems to be more of a macro shot than a miniature.  oh, well.</td>', 'forgive me for being dense, but i''m not sure how this meets the challenge.  even though i see small change, this seems to be more of a macro shot than a miniature.  oh, well.', '2004-08-05 21:14:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(845493, 94507, 23394, '<td valign="top">i see the little sprout in the trunk of the tree, and i guess i can stretch miniature to include that.  i think i''d like this better if the lighting wasn''t so harsh and if the angle was different.  this kinda feels more like a snapshot than anything else.</td>', 'i see the little sprout in the trunk of the tree, and i guess i can stretch miniature to include that.  i think i''d like this better if the lighting wasn''t so harsh and if the angle was different.  this kinda feels more like a snapshot than anything else.', '2004-08-05 21:16:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(845495, 94604, 23394, '<td valign="top">ok, this is an interesting image; actually, an impressive capture, considering the lighting and the detail.  unfortunately, for me, i feel it a stretch to consider a reflection a miniaturization.  oh well, maybe it''s just my problem.</td>', 'ok, this is an interesting image; actually, an impressive capture, considering the lighting and the detail.  unfortunately, for me, i feel it a stretch to consider a reflection a miniaturization.  oh well, maybe it''s just my problem.', '2004-08-05 21:19:19.000000', NULL, 1),
