(845549, 95447, 23394, '<td valign="top">great shot!  except i see your finger, i see your finger, i see your finger, i see your finger...oh, i momentarily forgot--this is basic editing.  great focus, great lighting, great detail.  one of my top picks.  hope it does well for you.</td>', 'great shot!  except i see your finger, i see your finger, i see your finger, i see your finger...oh, i momentarily forgot--this is basic editing.  great focus, great lighting, great detail.  one of my top picks.  hope it does well for you.', '2004-08-05 22:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
