(846163, 95525, 22748, '<td valign="top">The best I''ve seen yet! First, a great title. Next, cute subjects. I love how the big cat is looking down at the little one. The lighting is great. Nice seamless background. Nice detail in the cat fur, this is a really sharp image. <br/> <br/>Excellent work.</td>', 'The best I''ve seen yet! First, a great title. Next, cute subjects. I love how the big cat is looking down at the little one. The lighting is great. Nice seamless background. Nice detail in the cat fur, this is a really sharp image.  Excellent work.', '2004-08-06 06:52:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(846167, 95523, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool! Great lighting and I like how the background is all dark. Very nice idea.</td>', 'Cool! Great lighting and I like how the background is all dark. Very nice idea.', '2004-08-06 06:57:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(846170, 94917, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool, it''s really hard to tell they''re not life size. Or, maybe they are.... :)  I''d like at least the red car to be in focus, however. Both it, and the background are mostly OOF so there seems to be no good focus here. Actually the car on the right side (cut off) is pretty sharp, but it doesn''t seem to make a good focal point.</td>', 'Cool, it''s really hard to tell they''re not life size. Or, maybe they are.... :)  I''d like at least the red car to be in focus, however. Both it, and the background are mostly OOF so there seems to be no good focus here. Actually the car on the right side (cut off) is pretty sharp, but it doesn''t seem to make a good focal point.', '2004-08-06 07:01:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(846176, 94708, 22748, '<td valign="top">LOL. Must have had fun making this image. This, of course, is the idea most of us had when we read the challenge description, just no one else had the guts to actually enter the shot. I realized I would have to find someone else to model for me, since it has to be miniature. ;)</td>', 'LOL. Must have had fun making this image. This, of course, is the idea most of us had when we read the challenge description, just no one else had the guts to actually enter the shot. I realized I would have to find someone else to model for me, since it has to be miniature. ;)', '2004-08-06 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(846177, 95579, 24983, '<td valign="top">an effective shot although to me the group of three are a little too far away fromthe main body and tend to be a picture within a picture</td>', 'an effective shot although to me the group of three are a little too far away fromthe main body and tend to be a picture within a picture', '2004-08-06 07:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(846179, 95674, 22748, '<td valign="top">The challenge is to make the impression that the "subject of your photo is a tinier version of something that is normally larger."  It doesn''t meet that challenge in my mind.</td>', 'The challenge is to make the impression that the "subject of your photo is a tinier version of something that is normally larger."  It doesn''t meet that challenge in my mind.', '2004-08-06 07:11:40.000000', NULL, 1),
