(846226, 94872, 23394, '<td valign="top">forgive me for being dense, but i''m not sure how this meets the challenge.  this seems to be more of a macro shot than a miniature (but then, maybe i need someone to explain it to me).  good focus, use of short dof.<br/> <br/>ok, i ''get it''...it has been explained to me.  i can say, ''it meets the challenge.''  compare the picture to the chess piece that is in focus.</td>', 'forgive me for being dense, but i''m not sure how this meets the challenge.  this seems to be more of a macro shot than a miniature (but then, maybe i need someone to explain it to me).  good focus, use of short dof. ok, i ''get it''...it has been explained to me.  i can say, ''it meets the challenge.''  compare the picture to the chess piece that is in focus.', '2004-08-06 08:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
