(846243, 95664, 15832, '<td valign="top">Really nice photo... I think it may score lower than it should because people will not take it as minuature enoygh.<br/>But i like this photo</td>', 'Really nice photo... I think it may score lower than it should because people will not take it as minuature enoygh.But i like this photo', '2004-08-06 08:40:57.000000', NULL, 1),
