(846315, 95640, 19841, '<td valign="top">it''s a bit difficult to pick out the cow on the oreo island. I suspect a lot of people will miss it altogether, which is a shame, because it''s a neat idea.  Perhpaps it would have shown up more in color.</td>', 'it''s a bit difficult to pick out the cow on the oreo island. I suspect a lot of people will miss it altogether, which is a shame, because it''s a neat idea.  Perhpaps it would have shown up more in color.', '2004-08-06 10:24:35.000000', NULL, 1),
