(846387, 94615, 24140, '<td valign="top">innovative use of the tiny props... unless the dice are really 4'' high???  the white background really makes you see the board well too.  nice shot considering how small this probably really is.</td>', 'innovative use of the tiny props... unless the dice are really 4'' high???  the white background really makes you see the board well too.  nice shot considering how small this probably really is.', '2004-08-06 11:23:01.000000', NULL, 1),
