(847209, 94298, 23300, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot. I think the central composition works well. Perhaps the style could have been pushed even further by cropping it as a square and using a highly polished coin with even lighting and adding a border to the image.</td>', 'Nice clear shot. I think the central composition works well. Perhaps the style could have been pushed even further by cropping it as a square and using a highly polished coin with even lighting and adding a border to the image.', '2004-08-06 22:41:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(847213, 95671, 23300, '<td valign="top">I think the contrasting colours and textures between the truck and the cat work well. I would add a border to this image.</td>', 'I think the contrasting colours and textures between the truck and the cat work well. I would add a border to this image.', '2004-08-06 22:42:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(847219, 94248, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Youv''e actually given this little guy some character. Composition works well. I think a simple border would finish it off.</td>', 'Great shot. Youv''e actually given this little guy some character. Composition works well. I think a simple border would finish it off.', '2004-08-06 22:44:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(847222, 95049, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition works well. I don''t think it quite meets the challenge as there is nothing in the picture to indicate the size of the subject.</td>', 'The composition works well. I don''t think it quite meets the challenge as there is nothing in the picture to indicate the size of the subject.', '2004-08-06 22:46:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(847223, 95463, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting works really well. I think a bit more space at the bottom af the picture would balance it a little better.</td>', 'The lighting works really well. I think a bit more space at the bottom af the picture would balance it a little better.', '2004-08-06 22:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(847226, 95344, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting and composition work well. There are a couple of light marks on the background that are a little distracting.</td>', 'The lighting and composition work well. There are a couple of light marks on the background that are a little distracting.', '2004-08-06 22:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(847230, 95124, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. Great composition and depth of field work. I don''t think it meets the challenge though.</td>', 'Beautiful image. Great composition and depth of field work. I don''t think it meets the challenge though.', '2004-08-06 22:51:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(847231, 94614, 23300, '<td valign="top">I love the clarity and the colour. I think a more even light would add to this image. That is if there wes some diffused light on the right hand side as well to even out the background.</td>', 'I love the clarity and the colour. I think a more even light would add to this image. That is if there wes some diffused light on the right hand side as well to even out the background.', '2004-08-06 22:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(847236, 95423, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting works well on the chopper and the greenery. I think the flower and the chopper compete as subjects. The bright red of the chopper stands out well against the green. I think if it was positioned so that the area where the flower is was just all greenery it would provide more focus for the chopper.</td>', 'The lighting works well on the chopper and the greenery. I think the flower and the chopper compete as subjects. The bright red of the chopper stands out well against the green. I think if it was positioned so that the area where the flower is was just all greenery it would provide more focus for the chopper.', '2004-08-06 22:57:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(847238, 95490, 23300, '<td valign="top">What a cool little subject. The depth of field works well and so does the composition. Actually I think this shot might also work really well in black and white. There''s good contrast between the little guy and the hand.</td>', 'What a cool little subject. The depth of field works well and so does the composition. Actually I think this shot might also work really well in black and white. There''s good contrast between the little guy and the hand.', '2004-08-06 23:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(847242, 95674, 23300, '<td valign="top">Intersesting image. I think you could have gone even further with the idea to make it a bit more solid. I would suggest that the cropping could have more space at the top to have some blank space above the glass. Also a simple border would just top it of as something that could hang on a wall in a modern cafe. I would also sharpen it a little as the focus is a bit soft. The lighting could also have been diffused as it is a bit harsh and bright. Also you could consider the things that are reflecting in the glass. I don''t mean to harp on I just think this is a great idea with lots of potential and that its just a few technical things that stand out to me. Good luck.</td>', 'Intersesting image. I think you could have gone even further with the idea to make it a bit more solid. I would suggest that the cropping could have more space at the top to have some blank space above the glass. Also a simple border would just top it of as something that could hang on a wall in a modern cafe. I would also sharpen it a little as the focus is a bit soft. The lighting could also have been diffused as it is a bit harsh and bright. Also you could consider the things that are reflecting in the glass. I don''t mean to harp on I just think this is a great idea with lots of potential and that its just a few technical things that stand out to me. Good luck.', '2004-08-06 23:07:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(847245, 94718, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great composition. I love the vertical versus horizontal aspects of the subject matter. The lighting is good also. I think that given all the strong red in the picture that a dark background and bench top would have really emphasized the colour even more.</td>', 'Great composition. I love the vertical versus horizontal aspects of the subject matter. The lighting is good also. I think that given all the strong red in the picture that a dark background and bench top would have really emphasized the colour even more.', '2004-08-06 23:10:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(847249, 95635, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great composition. The border really works well too. The lighting adds real depth to the image.The head of the axe is just a little obscure in the shadow at the front so that it takes a moment for me to actually identify what the scene is. Nice image though.</td>', 'Great composition. The border really works well too. The lighting adds real depth to the image.The head of the axe is just a little obscure in the shadow at the front so that it takes a moment for me to actually identify what the scene is. Nice image though.', '2004-08-06 23:13:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(847253, 95033, 23300, '<td valign="top">The general lighting works well. The glare on the spoon is a little distracting. I think a bit more space to the right would help so that the handle wasn''t touching the edge.</td>', 'The general lighting works well. The glare on the spoon is a little distracting. I think a bit more space to the right would help so that the handle wasn''t touching the edge.', '2004-08-06 23:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(847255, 95682, 23772, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and lighting of this one!</td>', 'Love the composition and lighting of this one!', '2004-08-06 23:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(847256, 94351, 23772, '<td valign="top">Very clever</td>', 'Very clever', '2004-08-06 23:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(847258, 95544, 23772, '<td valign="top">Uhm...sorry, but what is miniature about this one?  Is it a toy car?</td>', 'Uhm...sorry, but what is miniature about this one?  Is it a toy car?', '2004-08-06 23:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(847259, 95595, 23772, '<td valign="top">A bit out of focus...</td>', 'A bit out of focus...', '2004-08-06 23:18:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(847261, 95607, 23300, '<td valign="top">At first glance this almost looks like a real stadium. There is a lot of noise in the picture. Maybe the ISO setting was high on your camera. I think the composition works well. However there is nothing in the image to give a sense of scale. I can''t tell how big or small the subject is.</td>', 'At first glance this almost looks like a real stadium. There is a lot of noise in the picture. Maybe the ISO setting was high on your camera. I think the composition works well. However there is nothing in the image to give a sense of scale. I can''t tell how big or small the subject is.', '2004-08-06 23:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(847263, 95482, 23772, '<td valign="top">Nice focus at all depths...</td>', 'Nice focus at all depths...', '2004-08-06 23:18:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(847264, 94984, 23772, '<td valign="top">Too bad the truck is out of focus...<br/> <br/>Title doesnt make sense...</td>', 'Too bad the truck is out of focus... Title doesnt make sense...', '2004-08-06 23:20:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(847268, 95554, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the random balance that you''ve created. The depth of field works well too. The focus seems a little soft. I think a border would help to "contain" the subject matter. You''ve made a bunch of quite different objects into quite an interesting picture.</td>', 'I like the random balance that you''ve created. The depth of field works well too. The focus seems a little soft. I think a border would help to "contain" the subject matter. You''ve made a bunch of quite different objects into quite an interesting picture.', '2004-08-06 23:21:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(847273, 95383, 16033, '<td valign="top">keep it rollin'' mate!</td>', 'keep it rollin'' mate!', '2004-08-06 23:24:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(847275, 94872, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. The colour, lighting, DOF and composition are all beautiful. The border works well too. This image has a luxurious feel about it. The texture in the foreground works so well against the softened background. Well Done.</td>', 'Beautiful image. The colour, lighting, DOF and composition are all beautiful. The border works well too. This image has a luxurious feel about it. The texture in the foreground works so well against the softened background. Well Done.', '2004-08-06 23:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(847279, 95584, 23300, '<td valign="top">The random balance of the subject works well. I think the lighting highlights the image a bit unevenly. Maybe another light from the bottom right could add a bit more life to the image as it is a little "flat". A liitle sharpening would add some more life to it also.</td>', 'The random balance of the subject works well. I think the lighting highlights the image a bit unevenly. Maybe another light from the bottom right could add a bit more life to the image as it is a little "flat". A liitle sharpening would add some more life to it also.', '2004-08-06 23:30:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(847282, 95429, 23300, '<td valign="top">Lovely. The composition is interesting and I think it works well. The colour and lighting are beautiful. The blue tint on the background compliments the flowers really well. The textures are inspiring and the soft focus is inspired.</td>', 'Lovely. The composition is interesting and I think it works well. The colour and lighting are beautiful. The blue tint on the background compliments the flowers really well. The textures are inspiring and the soft focus is inspired.', '2004-08-06 23:32:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(847288, 95543, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image makes an instant impact. The colours and lighting are handled expertly. The composition works really well and the depth of field work is perfect</td>', 'This image makes an instant impact. The colours and lighting are handled expertly. The composition works really well and the depth of field work is perfect', '2004-08-06 23:35:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(847293, 95539, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. This image generates a really sombre mood. It almost creates a sense of silence.The only negative is that it does appear a little dark to me. Good Luck.</td>', 'Beautiful composition. This image generates a really sombre mood. It almost creates a sense of silence.The only negative is that it does appear a little dark to me. Good Luck.', '2004-08-06 23:37:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(847296, 95440, 23300, '<td valign="top">The composition works really well. The harsh lighting on the arms a bit distracting though.</td>', 'The composition works really well. The harsh lighting on the arms a bit distracting though.', '2004-08-06 23:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(847303, 94759, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really like the composition and the border finishes it off nicely. Nice work with the lighting too. The empty white space on the right really pushes the blue plastic making it look hard and bright. This would also make a good black and white image.</td>', 'I really like the composition and the border finishes it off nicely. Nice work with the lighting too. The empty white space on the right really pushes the blue plastic making it look hard and bright. This would also make a good black and white image.', '2004-08-06 23:41:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(847305, 95545, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. The depth of field speaks for itself. The lighting is great and the texture at the front works really well against the metal. This image gives a real sense of wanting to be careful not to bump the table.</td>', 'Beautiful image. The depth of field speaks for itself. The lighting is great and the texture at the front works really well against the metal. This image gives a real sense of wanting to be careful not to bump the table.', '2004-08-06 23:44:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(847315, 95396, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image is really fun. Makes me laugh. The curvature looks wild. Personally I would crop it to remove the section at the top just leaving the material and the kitten and perhaps adjust channels or levels to produce a little more contrast to push the textures out a bit. Great shot.</td>', 'This image is really fun. Makes me laugh. The curvature looks wild. Personally I would crop it to remove the section at the top just leaving the material and the kitten and perhaps adjust channels or levels to produce a little more contrast to push the textures out a bit. Great shot.', '2004-08-06 23:48:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(847325, 94926, 23300, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of lighting. Such a clear image.</td>', 'Excellent use of lighting. Such a clear image.', '2004-08-06 23:50:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(847330, 95603, 23300, '<td valign="top">Awesome. Youv''e made this look like a real race. The depth of field effect does amazing things to the sense of motion. The only negative is the sign in the middle at the top that has caught the light.</td>', 'Awesome. Youv''e made this look like a real race. The depth of field effect does amazing things to the sense of motion. The only negative is the sign in the middle at the top that has caught the light.', '2004-08-06 23:52:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(847332, 95544, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful image. I love the composition and the lighting.</td>', 'Beautiful image. I love the composition and the lighting.', '2004-08-06 23:53:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(847358, 95632, 23300, '<td valign="top">Awesome image. This scene has been artistically crafted. The lighting and the composition are so well done. The mood generated is powerful. I really admire your ability to generate such strong emotinal communication through such inanimate objects.</td>', 'Awesome image. This scene has been artistically crafted. The lighting and the composition are so well done. The mood generated is powerful. I really admire your ability to generate such strong emotinal communication through such inanimate objects.', '2004-08-07 00:16:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(847360, 95540, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great. The lighting is nothing short of awesome.</td>', 'Great. The lighting is nothing short of awesome.', '2004-08-07 00:18:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(847363, 95668, 23300, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image. This image generates a surprisingly moody atmosphere.</td>', 'Wonderful image. This image generates a surprisingly moody atmosphere.', '2004-08-07 00:21:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(847372, 95466, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. This one is a winner to me. The lighting and composition are great. This is simply a beautiful image. It offers suggestions of delicacy and strength at the same time. I find this image to be so evocative. It could be used to express themes ranging from science to art or from nature to religion. Well Done and Good Luck.</td>', 'Beautiful. This one is a winner to me. The lighting and composition are great. This is simply a beautiful image. It offers suggestions of delicacy and strength at the same time. I find this image to be so evocative. It could be used to express themes ranging from science to art or from nature to religion. Well Done and Good Luck.', '2004-08-07 00:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(847376, 95228, 23300, '<td valign="top">Beautiful. The colouring and textures are exquisite. Well done with the lighting to make the most of them. This image is quite evocative. To me it speaks of dignity in death and beauty in all things. This is a wonderful and gentle image.</td>', 'Beautiful. The colouring and textures are exquisite. Well done with the lighting to make the most of them. This image is quite evocative. To me it speaks of dignity in death and beauty in all things. This is a wonderful and gentle image.', '2004-08-07 00:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(847377, 94852, 23300, '<td valign="top">The central composition works for this image. I would suggest that if the man was wearing overalls and boots or something that linked him to the train idea that it would make the image stronger.</td>', 'The central composition works for this image. I would suggest that if the man was wearing overalls and boots or something that linked him to the train idea that it would make the image stronger.', '2004-08-07 00:32:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(847378, 95636, 23300, '<td valign="top">Great image. The composition is so strong. The lighting and other technical aspects are flawless. The textures work well together and the cropping is ideal.</td>', 'Great image. The composition is so strong. The lighting and other technical aspects are flawless. The textures work well together and the cropping is ideal.', '2004-08-07 00:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(847384, 95494, 23300, '<td valign="top">This is a lovely image. The lighting is quite interesting and the composition works really well. Somehow the sunlight and its effects on the left side of the image create emotions like hope and optimism. On the negative side I can''t see the connection to the challenge. Beautiful image all the same.</td>', 'This is a lovely image. The lighting is quite interesting and the composition works really well. Somehow the sunlight and its effects on the left side of the image create emotions like hope and optimism. On the negative side I can''t see the connection to the challenge. Beautiful image all the same.', '2004-08-07 00:38:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(847392, 94524, 23300, '<td valign="top">Awesome. I love the composition and the lighting</td>', 'Awesome. I love the composition and the lighting', '2004-08-07 00:44:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(847393, 95044, 11895, '<td valign="top">fits the challenge well, the focus is sharp but needs more depth of field</td>', 'fits the challenge well, the focus is sharp but needs more depth of field', '2004-08-07 00:46:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(847396, 95487, 23300, '<td valign="top">I really love your use of light and how you have used it to set up the composition. The textures all work so well together and the various directional elements created by the highlights are really quite powerful. This image generates two moods at once. One that is a little comical and the other that is rather sombre and moody. The term "dark comedy" comes to mind.</td>', 'I really love your use of light and how you have used it to set up the composition. The textures all work so well together and the various directional elements created by the highlights are really quite powerful. This image generates two moods at once. One that is a little comical and the other that is rather sombre and moody. The term "dark comedy" comes to mind.', '2004-08-07 00:48:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(847398, 94740, 23300, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and composition.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and composition.', '2004-08-07 00:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(847399, 94568, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting works well to enhance the strong colours and textures. The cropping and composition work well to enhance the difference in the size of the two objects.</td>', 'The lighting works well to enhance the strong colours and textures. The cropping and composition work well to enhance the difference in the size of the two objects.', '2004-08-07 00:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(847403, 95701, 23300, '<td valign="top">Wow. Great idea and executed so well. Not only is this an artistically crafted scene it is also an evocative and engaging image.</td>', 'Wow. Great idea and executed so well. Not only is this an artistically crafted scene it is also an evocative and engaging image.', '2004-08-07 00:55:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(847408, 94604, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the contrast between the textures of the old building and the smoothness of the modern car and wiper. The content in the top left corner detract from the impact of the main subject. It could possibly still work even with top and left cropped to remove the background details. Making the image black and white as well might help to enhance the difference in the texture even more.</td>', 'I like the contrast between the textures of the old building and the smoothness of the modern car and wiper. The content in the top left corner detract from the impact of the main subject. It could possibly still work even with top and left cropped to remove the background details. Making the image black and white as well might help to enhance the difference in the texture even more.', '2004-08-07 01:02:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(847411, 95618, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting is nice and even and the composition is well balanced.</td>', 'The lighting is nice and even and the composition is well balanced.', '2004-08-07 01:04:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(847415, 95370, 23300, '<td valign="top">The lighting and composition work well. The object on the right hand side that is reflected in the surface detracts from the impact of your composition though. I would suggest that a dark matt surface would really enhance the colour of the truck and contrast well with the rice.</td>', 'The lighting and composition work well. The object on the right hand side that is reflected in the surface detracts from the impact of your composition though. I would suggest that a dark matt surface would really enhance the colour of the truck and contrast well with the rice.', '2004-08-07 01:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(847420, 94466, 24389, '<td valign="top">Its kinda out of focus....and you can''t really tell what the big blue thing is, although i''m guessing its a hat.....</td>', 'Its kinda out of focus....and you can''t really tell what the big blue thing is, although i''m guessing its a hat.....', '2004-08-07 01:16:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(847421, 95437, 24389, '<td valign="top">so which one is miniture?! the tree or the mantis? ha ha, i like it.</td>', 'so which one is miniture?! the tree or the mantis? ha ha, i like it.', '2004-08-07 01:17:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(847422, 95593, 23300, '<td valign="top">Ver funny. Well composed. I can almost smell it! (Is that a good or a bad thing.)</td>', 'Ver funny. Well composed. I can almost smell it! (Is that a good or a bad thing.)', '2004-08-07 01:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
