(847426, 95480, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image has a lot of impact. The composition is great. The colours work really well together. The contrasting textures really enhance each other also.</td>', 'This image has a lot of impact. The composition is great. The colours work really well together. The contrasting textures really enhance each other also.', '2004-08-07 01:21:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(847427, 95124, 23939, '<td valign="top">ic now. my bad   i missed the title 7</td>', 'ic now. my bad   i missed the title 7', '2004-08-07 01:23:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(847428, 95600, 22613, '<td valign="top">perfect!</td>', 'perfect!', '2004-08-07 01:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(847432, 95055, 23300, '<td valign="top">This image is really playful. The first thing I thought was "how did they gat a real elephant to do that.......actually, where did they get a real elephant?" My only suggestion is in relation to the composition. Could I suggest that if the liitle blue elephant was placed a touch further back and then to the right at about the 1/3 mark from the right then he would line up with the large elephant in relation to the lines in the floorboards. That is the angle of the floorboards would run from the large elephants belly to the small elephants belly. This just feels like it would strengthen the composition. Good luck with the challenge.</td>', 'This image is really playful. The first thing I thought was "how did they gat a real elephant to do that.......actually, where did they get a real elephant?" My only suggestion is in relation to the composition. Could I suggest that if the liitle blue elephant was placed a touch further back and then to the right at about the 1/3 mark from the right then he would line up with the large elephant in relation to the lines in the floorboards. That is the angle of the floorboards would run from the large elephants belly to the small elephants belly. This just feels like it would strengthen the composition. Good luck with the challenge.', '2004-08-07 01:29:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(847434, 95523, 22613, '<td valign="top">great use of black!</td>', 'great use of black!', '2004-08-07 01:30:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(847435, 94195, 22613, '<td valign="top">it looks like a cover of some book....mmmm interesting. love it!</td>', 'it looks like a cover of some book....mmmm interesting. love it!', '2004-08-07 01:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(847438, 94879, 22613, '<td valign="top">nice picture</td>', 'nice picture', '2004-08-07 01:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(847439, 95664, 22613, '<td valign="top">interesting perspective-heh</td>', 'interesting perspective-heh', '2004-08-07 01:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(847440, 95581, 23300, '<td valign="top">I like the way the colours on the floor act as a pastel version of the colours in the globe. I also like the way that you used the glare from the light to act as the sun, as the title suggests. It would be interesting to see this done with the lights off and using a torch as a light source to take it to the extreme level. The only negative comment I have is that the tag that''s hanging off the globe detracts a bit from the image. Good Luck with the challenge.</td>', 'I like the way the colours on the floor act as a pastel version of the colours in the globe. I also like the way that you used the glare from the light to act as the sun, as the title suggests. It would be interesting to see this done with the lights off and using a torch as a light source to take it to the extreme level. The only negative comment I have is that the tag that''s hanging off the globe detracts a bit from the image. Good Luck with the challenge.', '2004-08-07 01:34:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(847457, 95570, 24659, '<td valign="top">I think it''s awesome how there are three of them, piled up on top of each other.  I don''t know how much snail wrangling you had to do, but good job!</td>', 'I think it''s awesome how there are three of them, piled up on top of each other.  I don''t know how much snail wrangling you had to do, but good job!', '2004-08-07 01:52:31.000000', NULL, 1),
