(847578, 94838, 23300, '<td valign="top">This shot is a winner in this challenge. The colour, DOF, light and composition are all excellent. That little white speck in front of the mini pawn is the only flaw. Beautiful work. This image really creates a mood. The sense of feeling overwhelmed or perhaps protected by the scale of the surrounding pieces.</td>', 'This shot is a winner in this challenge. The colour, DOF, light and composition are all excellent. That little white speck in front of the mini pawn is the only flaw. Beautiful work. This image really creates a mood. The sense of feeling overwhelmed or perhaps protected by the scale of the surrounding pieces.', '2004-08-07 04:22:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(847579, 95583, 24983, '<td valign="top">the imagination is stretched a bit.</td>', 'the imagination is stretched a bit.', '2004-08-07 04:22:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(847580, 94615, 24983, '<td valign="top">good shot nice touch with the dice</td>', 'good shot nice touch with the dice', '2004-08-07 04:24:06.000000', NULL, 1),
