(848331, 95664, 19608, '<td valign="top">Nice nature shot - good looking waterfall. The yellow daisies add a nice touch.  Your composition is a bit too centered to be really effective.  Finally, you were supposed to shoot something that was a tinier version of something that is normally larger.  This is not one.</td>', 'Nice nature shot - good looking waterfall. The yellow daisies add a nice touch.  Your composition is a bit too centered to be really effective.  Finally, you were supposed to shoot something that was a tinier version of something that is normally larger.  This is not one.', '2004-08-07 18:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(848332, 94298, 24642, '<td valign="top">Good idea.</td>', 'Good idea.', '2004-08-07 18:29:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(848334, 95020, 19608, '<td valign="top">Oops - almost could miss the little fella!~  Nice composition and exposure.  The only complaint I have is the gray/green background isn''t terrible attractive.  Black would really set off the red hearts.</td>', 'Oops - almost could miss the little fella!~  Nice composition and exposure.  The only complaint I have is the gray/green background isn''t terrible attractive.  Black would really set off the red hearts.', '2004-08-07 18:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(848356, 95606, 19608, '<td valign="top">Funny!  Nice idea cleverly executed.  I like the way you tipped the log so that the ant is going uphill.  Exposure is good; composition is nice.  The ant is a bit difficult to make out.  The oval white "border" is not pleasing.</td>', 'Funny!  Nice idea cleverly executed.  I like the way you tipped the log so that the ant is going uphill.  Exposure is good; composition is nice.  The ant is a bit difficult to make out.  The oval white "border" is not pleasing.', '2004-08-07 19:16:25.000000', NULL, 1),
