(848497, 95629, 19608, '<td valign="top">This image has "everything" going for it.  Perfect:  exposure, composition, objects, lighting, focus, and yes - emotion.  I don''t know or care how you got the wood of each instrument to be so similarily colored, but it''s great.  Even the title is impressive.  If you are not French - the use of French words for the image shows true imagination.</td>', 'This image has "everything" going for it.  Perfect:  exposure, composition, objects, lighting, focus, and yes - emotion.  I don''t know or care how you got the wood of each instrument to be so similarily colored, but it''s great.  Even the title is impressive.  If you are not French - the use of French words for the image shows true imagination.', '2004-08-07 23:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(848499, 95619, 19608, '<td valign="top">Hehe - in a great kinda way!  The use of the fish and fisherman is true genious.  Great exposure and focus.  Composition-wise, you don''t need all the bottom - it''s oof and doesn''t add anything.  Try cropping out at least 1/2 or better yet 2/3 of the distance from the base to the lip of the cup.  Even with that distraction, it''s in my top 10.</td>', 'Hehe - in a great kinda way!  The use of the fish and fisherman is true genious.  Great exposure and focus.  Composition-wise, you don''t need all the bottom - it''s oof and doesn''t add anything.  Try cropping out at least 1/2 or better yet 2/3 of the distance from the base to the lip of the cup.  Even with that distraction, it''s in my top 10.', '2004-08-07 23:27:17.000000', NULL, 1),
