(849257, 95525, 8643, '<td valign="top">Brilliant - love the black and white in colour!</td>', 'Brilliant - love the black and white in colour!', '2004-08-08 17:25:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(849258, 95583, 19608, '<td valign="top">You have a pleasing skyline - nice shot.  Sky is pretty blah   - too bad there''s not more blue and clod definition.  I think you missed the point on the miniature object.</td>', 'You have a pleasing skyline - nice shot.  Sky is pretty blah   - too bad there''s not more blue and clod definition.  I think you missed the point on the miniature object.', '2004-08-08 17:25:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(849261, 95669, 19608, '<td valign="top">hehe.  Th little painting with the red flower is an excellent touch.</td>', 'hehe.  Th little painting with the red flower is an excellent touch.', '2004-08-08 17:27:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(849262, 94248, 8643, '<td valign="top">Lovely clear shot, excellet macro.</td>', 'Lovely clear shot, excellet macro.', '2004-08-08 17:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(849263, 95371, 8643, '<td valign="top">Very sweet, nicpey composed, excellent control of DoF</td>', 'Very sweet, nicpey composed, excellent control of DoF', '2004-08-08 17:28:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(849265, 95396, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a great kiity picture - eyes are superbly focused and exposed.  The little red nose adds impact.  But - what is miniature?</td>', 'It''s a great kiity picture - eyes are superbly focused and exposed.  The little red nose adds impact.  But - what is miniature?', '2004-08-08 17:29:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(849266, 95701, 8643, '<td valign="top">Very clever idea, excellent execution.</td>', 'Very clever idea, excellent execution.', '2004-08-08 17:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(849268, 95204, 19608, '<td valign="top">The idea was good, colors are nice.  I like the background - except for the sand/dirt.  What represents miniature?</td>', 'The idea was good, colors are nice.  I like the background - except for the sand/dirt.  What represents miniature?', '2004-08-08 17:31:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(849269, 95563, 19608, '<td valign="top">He he.  Great object - well exposed and composed.  The white lines and brown dots on the top are a bit distracting.</td>', 'He he.  Great object - well exposed and composed.  The white lines and brown dots on the top are a bit distracting.', '2004-08-08 17:33:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(849271, 94765, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s an awesome sunset/sunrise shot - great colors. The wide angle lens did downsize the sun, but the idea was to shoot a miniature "something."</td>', 'It''s an awesome sunset/sunrise shot - great colors. The wide angle lens did downsize the sun, but the idea was to shoot a miniature "something."', '2004-08-08 17:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(849272, 95022, 19608, '<td valign="top">What a neat idea! Everything works except the exposure seems a good full stop hot.</td>', 'What a neat idea! Everything works except the exposure seems a good full stop hot.', '2004-08-08 17:36:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(849325, 95480, 19608, '<td valign="top">Wow - this looks very REAL!  Nice job.  The red lights in the background reall add some nice impact.</td>', 'Wow - this looks very REAL!  Nice job.  The red lights in the background reall add some nice impact.', '2004-08-08 18:28:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(849329, 95698, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your idea was very good.  I like the orange coloration, but the angle of the lighting and the angle you took the shot makes it rather difficult too see the "facial" area.</td>', 'Your idea was very good.  I like the orange coloration, but the angle of the lighting and the angle you took the shot makes it rather difficult too see the "facial" area.', '2004-08-08 18:32:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(849331, 95619, 9162, '<td valign="top">great shot &amp; really meets the challenge</td>', 'great shot & really meets the challenge', '2004-08-08 18:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(849333, 94248, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s an exceptional macro - perfect lighting and focus.  But the only thing that makes it a miniature version of something that is normally larger - is your title.   It''s too bad because the photo is so excellent, hope you entered something similar in the macro IV.</td>', 'It''s an exceptional macro - perfect lighting and focus.  But the only thing that makes it a miniature version of something that is normally larger - is your title.   It''s too bad because the photo is so excellent, hope you entered something similar in the macro IV.', '2004-08-08 18:35:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(849334, 94491, 19608, '<td valign="top">The colors are nice and compliment each other well.  But, I don''t get the miniature object, is there one?  The oof leaves in the foreground really detract.</td>', 'The colors are nice and compliment each other well.  But, I don''t get the miniature object, is there one?  The oof leaves in the foreground really detract.', '2004-08-08 18:37:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(849337, 95619, 11800, '<td valign="top">This is such a cool idea. I like the goldfish but it would have been even more fun to have a piece of glass or a mirror inside the bowl to look like water and lines on their poles. So far, this is one of the best though. 10</td>', 'This is such a cool idea. I like the goldfish but it would have been even more fun to have a piece of glass or a mirror inside the bowl to look like water and lines on their poles. So far, this is one of the best though. 10', '2004-08-08 18:38:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(849338, 95704, 19608, '<td valign="top">Your composition and lighting work very well.  Does that say 1/4 ounce?  That''s enough for one omelette!</td>', 'Your composition and lighting work very well.  Does that say 1/4 ounce?  That''s enough for one omelette!', '2004-08-08 18:39:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(849340, 95499, 19608, '<td valign="top">It a very interesting composition using a good subject.  Highlights are blown away in a couple spots.</td>', 'It a very interesting composition using a good subject.  Highlights are blown away in a couple spots.', '2004-08-08 18:40:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(849341, 94351, 11800, '<td valign="top">Funny and good. Well thought out. Who had to clean up the mess? 9</td>', 'Funny and good. Well thought out. Who had to clean up the mess? 9', '2004-08-08 18:41:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(849344, 95604, 19608, '<td valign="top">Excellent composition and lighting - the entire image really works well.  Background color selection is perfect. Have your model quit the nail biting.</td>', 'Excellent composition and lighting - the entire image really works well.  Background color selection is perfect. Have your model quit the nail biting.', '2004-08-08 18:43:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(849345, 95701, 11800, '<td valign="top">The crayon really makes this shot. Excellent dof.  Can''t wait to see who the brilliant photographer is.</td>', 'The crayon really makes this shot. Excellent dof.  Can''t wait to see who the brilliant photographer is.', '2004-08-08 18:44:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(849347, 94278, 19608, '<td valign="top">That is one gorgeous slipper.  Great composition and lighting.  One of the best in the challenge.</td>', 'That is one gorgeous slipper.  Great composition and lighting.  One of the best in the challenge.', '2004-08-08 18:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(849351, 95689, 11800, '<td valign="top">It seems that I am rating all the funny pictures higher for this challenge. I''m thinking that the color is off but it might be because of the weather. Could be sharper too. But the concept and her expression are downright cute. I''d have never thought of this one. 8</td>', 'It seems that I am rating all the funny pictures higher for this challenge. I''m thinking that the color is off but it might be because of the weather. Could be sharper too. But the concept and her expression are downright cute. I''d have never thought of this one. 8', '2004-08-08 18:47:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(849352, 95701, 19608, '<td valign="top">It''s a fantastic optical illusion.  I would guess the crayon is way OVERSIZED rather than miniature, due to its relationship with the wood.  But I still like the image a lot - one of the most creative in the challenge.</td>', 'It''s a fantastic optical illusion.  I would guess the crayon is way OVERSIZED rather than miniature, due to its relationship with the wood.  But I still like the image a lot - one of the most creative in the challenge.', '2004-08-08 18:47:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(849354, 95694, 19608, '<td valign="top">Great subject photographed with the perfect background.  The soft lighting really makes this a strong image. I think you could have found a more artictic way to create the composition.</td>', 'Great subject photographed with the perfect background.  The soft lighting really makes this a strong image. I think you could have found a more artictic way to create the composition.', '2004-08-08 18:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(849357, 95600, 11800, '<td valign="top">That''s the best snail picture I''ve seen and it is perfect for this challenge because it''s the boat that''s small. It looks like there is a lot of compression in the picture. Other than that, I like it. 8</td>', 'That''s the best snail picture I''ve seen and it is perfect for this challenge because it''s the boat that''s small. It looks like there is a lot of compression in the picture. Other than that, I like it. 8', '2004-08-08 18:50:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(849359, 94540, 19608, '<td valign="top">Perfect background brings out the other colors very nicely.  Your lighting is just right. The pun in your title - with the pineapple rings - is pretty clever too.</td>', 'Perfect background brings out the other colors very nicely.  Your lighting is just right. The pun in your title - with the pineapple rings - is pretty clever too.', '2004-08-08 18:51:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(849360, 95480, 11800, '<td valign="top">Good job with the lights and the yellow stripe.  I think it''s the best of the car photos. 8</td>', 'Good job with the lights and the yellow stripe.  I think it''s the best of the car photos. 8', '2004-08-08 18:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(849361, 95540, 19608, '<td valign="top">This works exceptionally well in B&amp;W.  Unusual TP - not much texture showing.  I don''t care for the white-line border.</td>', 'This works exceptionally well in B&W.  Unusual TP - not much texture showing.  I don''t care for the white-line border.', '2004-08-08 18:53:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(849365, 94879, 19608, '<td valign="top">A very moody and creative image.  What is miniature?</td>', 'A very moody and creative image.  What is miniature?', '2004-08-08 18:55:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(849366, 95008, 11800, '<td valign="top">I like this one. It is well set up but, imo, you missed the meaning of the challenge. The viewer needs something within the frame to compare the size to. It didn''t say just photograph something small. 6</td>', 'I like this one. It is well set up but, imo, you missed the meaning of the challenge. The viewer needs something within the frame to compare the size to. It didn''t say just photograph something small. 6', '2004-08-08 18:59:26.000000', NULL, 1),
