(849584, 94736, 23294, '<td valign="top">Bonus points just for matching the mini with the real.  Or is it just a larger mini?  I like the texture they''re on too.  8.</td>', 'Bonus points just for matching the mini with the real.  Or is it just a larger mini?  I like the texture they''re on too.  8.', '2004-08-08 21:53:29.000000', NULL, 1),
