(850828, 95703, 6999, '<td valign="top">Tricky with lighting - I actually like the area of daylight (?) top right, but I guess you''ll get a few comments against it. The noise in the areas around the main light area is annoying, a touch: the fade through red, rather than the fact of it''s fading, looks kind of messy, especially given the blue surrounding areas. Perhaps just a WB thing, but I don''t see that it helps any.</td>', 'Tricky with lighting - I actually like the area of daylight (?) top right, but I guess you''ll get a few comments against it. The noise in the areas around the main light area is annoying, a touch: the fade through red, rather than the fact of it''s fading, looks kind of messy, especially given the blue surrounding areas. Perhaps just a WB thing, but I don''t see that it helps any.', '2004-08-09 13:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
