(850928, 94897, 13365, '<td valign="top">Very snapshotish, the composition lends me to think that the pillows are the subject of the picture. I barley notice the toys on the chair.  Try getting closer and lower to the subjects to give a sense of scale</td>', 'Very snapshotish, the composition lends me to think that the pillows are the subject of the picture. I barley notice the toys on the chair.  Try getting closer and lower to the subjects to give a sense of scale', '2004-08-09 14:34:25.000000', NULL, 1),
