(850936, 95375, 13365, '<td valign="top">try having him look into frame for a better composition</td>', 'try having him look into frame for a better composition', '2004-08-09 14:37:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(850938, 94917, 6999, '<td valign="top">Strange composition - there''s something intriguing here though. It seems obvious that these must be miniature cars, but exactly what it is that communicates that is different to pin down as one looks - especially given details like the mud-spatters (it seems) on the nearer one. Depth of field is strange - don''t really feel like there''s a point to grab the attention here. The deception is good (though of course, a closer look allows the shut-lines, the warp of the cloth they''re on, the radiator panels etc. to give things away). I''m not going to penalise you for it, as i think it was poorly worded, but I think you''ve gone diametrically against the challenge, by the way. 6</td>', 'Strange composition - there''s something intriguing here though. It seems obvious that these must be miniature cars, but exactly what it is that communicates that is different to pin down as one looks - especially given details like the mud-spatters (it seems) on the nearer one. Depth of field is strange - don''t really feel like there''s a point to grab the attention here. The deception is good (though of course, a closer look allows the shut-lines, the warp of the cloth they''re on, the radiator panels etc. to give things away). I''m not going to penalise you for it, as i think it was poorly worded, but I think you''ve gone diametrically against the challenge, by the way. 6', '2004-08-09 14:37:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(850940, 95705, 13365, '<td valign="top">A tad out of focus and overexposed</td>', 'A tad out of focus and overexposed', '2004-08-09 14:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(850950, 95500, 6999, '<td valign="top">Don''t really get this, I''m afraid, in the context of the challenge. Difficult to be sure what your intention was, and the challenge idea was itself so nebulous ... <br/> <br/>There''s some good stuff here though - the depth of green on the leaves, and some of the detail, but I don''t find anything that really grabs my attention here.</td>', 'Don''t really get this, I''m afraid, in the context of the challenge. Difficult to be sure what your intention was, and the challenge idea was itself so nebulous ...  There''s some good stuff here though - the depth of green on the leaves, and some of the detail, but I don''t find anything that really grabs my attention here.', '2004-08-09 14:46:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(850957, 95396, 7628, '<td valign="top">What an expression!  The look on this kitten''s face makes the viewer realize how BIG the world looks when you are so small.  Perfect sentiment for this challenge.  The top of the frame is a bit hard to figure out - I''d say crop it out, but it does give some sense of scale. Perhaps a cloth with a distrinctive pattern that stretches high to completely cover the background would provide a better backdrop. The cat''s face and eyes and fur are pretty sharp, well illuminated.  an engaging shot.</td>', 'What an expression!  The look on this kitten''s face makes the viewer realize how BIG the world looks when you are so small.  Perfect sentiment for this challenge.  The top of the frame is a bit hard to figure out - I''d say crop it out, but it does give some sense of scale. Perhaps a cloth with a distrinctive pattern that stretches high to completely cover the background would provide a better backdrop. The cat''s face and eyes and fur are pretty sharp, well illuminated.  an engaging shot.', '2004-08-09 14:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(851008, 95007, 24962, '<td valign="top">Great picture, very atmospheric...would have scored 10 if the other people weren''t in the pic, they detract from the image slightly.</td>', 'Great picture, very atmospheric...would have scored 10 if the other people weren''t in the pic, they detract from the image slightly.', '2004-08-09 15:33:27.000000', NULL, 1),
