(851969, 95193, 7751, '<td valign="top">Looks like you spent a lot of time setting this up. I really like it. It does seem a tiny bit grainy, but it sorta makes it look hazy or smokey from the guns. Great job.</td>', 'Looks like you spent a lot of time setting this up. I really like it. It does seem a tiny bit grainy, but it sorta makes it look hazy or smokey from the guns. Great job.', '2004-08-10 01:59:45.000000', NULL, 1),
