(851977, 95689, 22385, '<td valign="top">A bit too dark - could use some extra lighting on the model.  Colors are bland - but increasing the lighting could succeed in producing vibrance.  Cute photo, though.</td>', 'A bit too dark - could use some extra lighting on the model.  Colors are bland - but increasing the lighting could succeed in producing vibrance.  Cute photo, though.', '2004-08-10 02:04:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(851979, 95646, 25061, '<td valign="top">Wow!  Awesome shot.  I like how you used a shallow depth of field to draw attention to the car - by the way, l''d love to own one of those babies!  The exposure and lighting are excellent.<br/>The only thing I would suggest is to zoom in on the car so we can really see it - and dream about it.<br/> <br/>Good job.</td>', 'Wow!  Awesome shot.  I like how you used a shallow depth of field to draw attention to the car - by the way, l''d love to own one of those babies!  The exposure and lighting are excellent.The only thing I would suggest is to zoom in on the car so we can really see it - and dream about it. Good job.', '2004-08-10 02:06:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(851989, 95632, 7751, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty neat picture. I love the way the little doll is looking up into the shadowy big dolls in the background.</td>', 'This is a pretty neat picture. I love the way the little doll is looking up into the shadowy big dolls in the background.', '2004-08-10 02:12:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(851999, 95078, 7751, '<td valign="top">I wish you could see the whole reflection of the little train in this. It seems like you could have brought it down just a bit to capture the top of the smokestack.</td>', 'I wish you could see the whole reflection of the little train in this. It seems like you could have brought it down just a bit to capture the top of the smokestack.', '2004-08-10 02:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
