(852124, 94879, 6999, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent image (though exactly what it''s doing in this challenge beats me). The balance of the larger drops with the darkness of the sky maintains interest across the frame, and the whole is so communicative of a mood, an atmosphere. The crop is very effective too. Good stuff.</td>', 'This is an excellent image (though exactly what it''s doing in this challenge beats me). The balance of the larger drops with the darkness of the sky maintains interest across the frame, and the whole is so communicative of a mood, an atmosphere. The crop is very effective too. Good stuff.', '2004-08-10 05:29:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(852133, 95629, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good subject choice, neatly carried out, and ideally lit - but it has the look of a catalogue shot, an illustration rather than a dynamic presentation. I think people will regard it as a bit ordinary - competent technical work only takes you so far as regards impact. 6</td>', 'Good subject choice, neatly carried out, and ideally lit - but it has the look of a catalogue shot, an illustration rather than a dynamic presentation. I think people will regard it as a bit ordinary - competent technical work only takes you so far as regards impact. 6', '2004-08-10 05:43:46.000000', NULL, 1),
