(852773, 95434, 20853, '<td valign="top">The table and out of focus background is a bit distracting.  It''s too obvious that it''s a book behind the car.  I think for this to work better, the mechanics shouldn''t be revealed.</td>', 'The table and out of focus background is a bit distracting.  It''s too obvious that it''s a book behind the car.  I think for this to work better, the mechanics shouldn''t be revealed.', '2004-08-10 16:56:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(852777, 94879, 22011, '<td valign="top">There always seems to be one shot per challenge that is far outside the challenge requirements, but is still an interesting photo....  Wonderful cloud scape, and it''s interesting you got focus on the window/drops rather than the outside world.  Whenever I take photos through the windsheild I try and get the focus outide the car.  Interesting ''life'' photo, although I don''t quite get the title.  I feel this is your art, rather than your entry, if you see what I mean, and on the basis of your it being your art, I give it a solid 8. :-).</td>', 'There always seems to be one shot per challenge that is far outside the challenge requirements, but is still an interesting photo....  Wonderful cloud scape, and it''s interesting you got focus on the window/drops rather than the outside world.  Whenever I take photos through the windsheild I try and get the focus outide the car.  Interesting ''life'' photo, although I don''t quite get the title.  I feel this is your art, rather than your entry, if you see what I mean, and on the basis of your it being your art, I give it a solid 8. :-).', '2004-08-10 16:58:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(852779, 95022, 18552, '<td valign="top">Love your picture - gave it a 10. It meets my interpretation of the challenge perfectly and I think the focus, color and composition are just right. That little loco just looks so cute sitting on the big tracks!</td>', 'Love your picture - gave it a 10. It meets my interpretation of the challenge perfectly and I think the focus, color and composition are just right. That little loco just looks so cute sitting on the big tracks!', '2004-08-10 16:59:16.000000', NULL, 1),
