(852790, 95618, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture of a mini backgammon - think if you had something normal sized in the picture besides the red dice it would have more obviously looked like it was a miniature; like a normal sized dice shaker cup. It''s hard to notice that the dice aren''t in scale with the little board.</td>', 'Very nice picture of a mini backgammon - think if you had something normal sized in the picture besides the red dice it would have more obviously looked like it was a miniature; like a normal sized dice shaker cup. It''s hard to notice that the dice aren''t in scale with the little board.', '2004-08-10 17:07:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(852795, 95421, 18552, '<td valign="top">The composition of your picture is nice and so it the look of the glass on the miniature piano. The whole picture looks a bit dark to my eyes and the lower right corner is really dark. I think this would have met the challenge better if you had taken a picture of it on top of a normal sized music book or piano to show that it was small. It would have looked really cute on top of a full sized book of music.</td>', 'The composition of your picture is nice and so it the look of the glass on the miniature piano. The whole picture looks a bit dark to my eyes and the lower right corner is really dark. I think this would have met the challenge better if you had taken a picture of it on top of a normal sized music book or piano to show that it was small. It would have looked really cute on top of a full sized book of music.', '2004-08-10 17:10:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(852798, 95700, 18552, '<td valign="top">To my mind this is the exact opposite of the challenge theme - this chair is huge and makes the lady look small. Instead of taking a picture of a miniature item you took a picture of a giant thing.</td>', 'To my mind this is the exact opposite of the challenge theme - this chair is huge and makes the lady look small. Instead of taking a picture of a miniature item you took a picture of a giant thing.', '2004-08-10 17:12:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(852802, 94826, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really a nice picture - these tiny golf carts look real. The flowers in the background show they are miniatures but you really have to look to see that. To me, this picture would have been better if there had just been one real sized golf ball on the grass - it would have shown instantly that these were miniature carts.</td>', 'Really a nice picture - these tiny golf carts look real. The flowers in the background show they are miniatures but you really have to look to see that. To me, this picture would have been better if there had just been one real sized golf ball on the grass - it would have shown instantly that these were miniature carts.', '2004-08-10 17:15:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(852804, 95259, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really a cute picture of a miniature village. At first I didn''t see the match that showed how small it was - if you had a normal sized thing more obviously in the picture I think it would have been nice. I bet lots of people didn''t even look closely enought at your picture to see the match.</td>', 'Really a cute picture of a miniature village. At first I didn''t see the match that showed how small it was - if you had a normal sized thing more obviously in the picture I think it would have been nice. I bet lots of people didn''t even look closely enought at your picture to see the match.', '2004-08-10 17:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(852808, 95702, 18552, '<td valign="top">Great idea for the challenge. The colors are nice and so is the focus. The lighting on the ball seems a bit bright. One of the little clubs leaning up against the ball would have been a nice touch, I think.</td>', 'Great idea for the challenge. The colors are nice and so is the focus. The lighting on the ball seems a bit bright. One of the little clubs leaning up against the ball would have been a nice touch, I think.', '2004-08-10 17:21:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(852811, 94926, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic photo - the focus, lighting and composition are great. I do think it would have been so much more suitable to have some full sized nails and perhaps another full sized tool or measuring tape of something in the picture to show how small it was instead of a quarter and a rock.</td>', 'This is a fantastic photo - the focus, lighting and composition are great. I do think it would have been so much more suitable to have some full sized nails and perhaps another full sized tool or measuring tape of something in the picture to show how small it was instead of a quarter and a rock.', '2004-08-10 17:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(852828, 94708, 5731, '<td valign="top">what do you mean? Is it Miniature?</td>', 'what do you mean? Is it Miniature?', '2004-08-10 17:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(852841, 94294, 18552, '<td valign="top">Really a cute picture! It''s also well taken. It''s a bit dark but still very clear. I think it would be a bit better if the bun and beer can didn''t look like they were floating in mid-air. Perhaps a bit more light so there was a hint of a shadow under the bun would have settled this down. Score - 8</td>', 'Really a cute picture! It''s also well taken. It''s a bit dark but still very clear. I think it would be a bit better if the bun and beer can didn''t look like they were floating in mid-air. Perhaps a bit more light so there was a hint of a shadow under the bun would have settled this down. Score - 8', '2004-08-10 17:38:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(852846, 95699, 24024, '<td valign="top">A closer crop might have helped an already great photo! Good job!</td>', 'A closer crop might have helped an already great photo! Good job!', '2004-08-10 17:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
