(852913, 95613, 22922, '<td valign="top">Very creative image and nice use of the tomato soup paste so it looks like it''s liquid (rippling).  Excellent entry for the challenge, it covers all the bases, clear frame of reference and clearly miniature items, interesting composition and a nice photo overall. A bit of grain on the soup can, and some distracting reflections on the bottom of the spoon.  Very sharp, good DOF and realistic color.</td>', 'Very creative image and nice use of the tomato soup paste so it looks like it''s liquid (rippling).  Excellent entry for the challenge, it covers all the bases, clear frame of reference and clearly miniature items, interesting composition and a nice photo overall. A bit of grain on the soup can, and some distracting reflections on the bottom of the spoon.  Very sharp, good DOF and realistic color.', '2004-08-10 18:28:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(852918, 95593, 22922, '<td valign="top">Very funny, excellent shot, great "expression" on the sheep''s face.  A daring subject, you pull it off nicely.  Exceptional DOF, good color and lighting, could use a bit less shadow on the sheep.</td>', 'Very funny, excellent shot, great "expression" on the sheep''s face.  A daring subject, you pull it off nicely.  Exceptional DOF, good color and lighting, could use a bit less shadow on the sheep.', '2004-08-10 18:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(852941, 95607, 18552, '<td valign="top">This is a nicely taken picture; however, how can one tell that this is a miniature stadium? If you had put a full size baseball in the stadium it would have made all the difference - then it would have been instantly obvious that this was a minature stadium.</td>', 'This is a nicely taken picture; however, how can one tell that this is a miniature stadium? If you had put a full size baseball in the stadium it would have made all the difference - then it would have been instantly obvious that this was a minature stadium.', '2004-08-10 18:47:45.000000', NULL, 1),
