(853257, 94320, 19708, '<td valign="top">Interesting &amp; unique composition.<br/>Guess my only critique on this, is the main focal point of the 1ml beaker is a bit too dead center and falls outside the sweet spots in the rule of thirds. The purple shadows &amp; reflections do add to the mood.<br/>A well-deserved ((7))<br/></td>', 'Interesting & unique composition.Guess my only critique on this, is the main focal point of the 1ml beaker is a bit too dead center and falls outside the sweet spots in the rule of thirds. The purple shadows & reflections do add to the mood.A well-deserved ((7))', '2004-08-10 23:45:28.000000', NULL, 1),
