(853266, 95664, 19708, '<td valign="top">This is a nice, scenic image, but there is really nothing in this image to suggest scale or anything is miniature in size. The foreground foliage appears to be real, suggesting the waterfall is real and large. If the foliage was miniature, something should have been beside it to show that it wasn''t.</td>', 'This is a nice, scenic image, but there is really nothing in this image to suggest scale or anything is miniature in size. The foreground foliage appears to be real, suggesting the waterfall is real and large. If the foliage was miniature, something should have been beside it to show that it wasn''t.', '2004-08-10 23:50:23.000000', NULL, 1),
