(853374, 95593, 19708, '<td valign="top">Congrats on a top 30 finish.<br/>Personally I thought this should have been in the top 5 and is now in my favorites. Puts a smile on my face everytime I look at it.<br/> <br/>Well Done!<br/></td>', 'Congrats on a top 30 finish.Personally I thought this should have been in the top 5 and is now in my favorites. Puts a smile on my face everytime I look at it. Well Done!', '2004-08-11 01:09:46.000000', NULL, 0),
