(853398, 95701, 17203, '<td valign="top">Doh! Missed by .008. The funny thing is, I''ve been thinking all week that this would probably place fourth. Oh well, at least it shows that voters aren''t as narrow-minded as some have suggested when it comes to challenge interpretations. ;-)</td>', 'Doh! Missed by .008. The funny thing is, I''ve been thinking all week that this would probably place fourth. Oh well, at least it shows that voters aren''t as narrow-minded as some have suggested when it comes to challenge interpretations. ;-)', '2004-08-11 01:18:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(853399, 95672, 18419, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone, especially Deannda! I knew going in that such a specific reference to a picture months ago might not go over, but figured what the heck!<br/> <br/>Still working on this sort of ''studio'' shot, so thanks again, and I''ll keep trying to get those silly feet in focus. I think the problem was that the camera was at ''head'' height, tilted forward to get everything in the shot; leaving the feet at a distance relative to the top. I''m happy with the lighting, though!<br/> <br/>Cheers<br/>Stu<br/> <br/></td>', 'Thanks everyone, especially Deannda! I knew going in that such a specific reference to a picture months ago might not go over, but figured what the heck! Still working on this sort of ''studio'' shot, so thanks again, and I''ll keep trying to get those silly feet in focus. I think the problem was that the camera was at ''head'' height, tilted forward to get everything in the shot; leaving the feet at a distance relative to the top. I''m happy with the lighting, though! CheersStu ', '2004-08-11 01:19:13.000000', NULL, 0),
(853401, 94879, 23939, '<td valign="top">its a mini sunny section. the raindrops match the weather; at the top where it is really dark and there anrent any where its sunny.</td>', 'its a mini sunny section. the raindrops match the weather; at the top where it is really dark and there anrent any where its sunny.', '2004-08-11 01:20:21.000000', NULL, 0),
