(853461, 95638, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 16th place finish. This image is impressive and in mean b/w.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 16th place finish. This image is impressive and in mean b/w.', '2004-08-11 01:35:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(853463, 95593, 714, '<td valign="top">Hahahahaha!!!</td>', 'Hahahahaha!!!', '2004-08-11 01:35:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(853468, 94820, 19672, '<td valign="top">Okay, i may have read the sentence to the theme wrong. I took the theme to be "miniature" and that we were to take a photo "that conveys to the viewer that the subject of your photo is a tinier version of something that is normally larger."<br/> <br/>So others have pointed out that the object was supposed to be something small....if so...oops.<br/> <br/>This came from a recent photoshoot i did:<br/><a href="//www.porthaven.com/rook" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">CLICK HERE</a> <br/> <br/>On the technical side....i was not very happy with this shoot. It was extremely sunny and i had never really photographed in such bright conditions.  I kicked myself afterwards for not using a polarized filter...live and learn!<br/> <br/>I am still very new to all of this...<br/> <br/>To those who still enjoyed the shot and the work that went into the toying of perspective...much thanks!<br/> <br/>- Jason</td>', 'Okay, i may have read the sentence to the theme wrong. I took the theme to be "miniature" and that we were to take a photo "that conveys to the viewer that the subject of your photo is a tinier version of something that is normally larger." So others have pointed out that the object was supposed to be something small....if so...oops. This came from a recent photoshoot i did:CLICK HERE  On the technical side....i was not very happy with this shoot. It was extremely sunny and i had never really photographed in such bright conditions.  I kicked myself afterwards for not using a polarized filter...live and learn! I am still very new to all of this... To those who still enjoyed the shot and the work that went into the toying of perspective...much thanks! - Jason', '2004-08-11 01:36:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(853474, 95112, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 17th place finish. A good use for this contraption or extra hands as they call them.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 17th place finish. A good use for this contraption or extra hands as they call them.', '2004-08-11 01:37:44.000000', NULL, 0),
