(853491, 95695, 22734, '<td valign="top">Congratulations on your 18th place finish. Had that crease been absent this may have taken a ribbon. nevertheless, you certainly outdid yourself. I was floored when I saw the little truck with those razor sharp batteries. Very good work.</td>', 'Congratulations on your 18th place finish. Had that crease been absent this may have taken a ribbon. nevertheless, you certainly outdid yourself. I was floored when I saw the little truck with those razor sharp batteries. Very good work.', '2004-08-11 01:41:13.000000', NULL, 0),
