(853859, 95007, 15006, '<td valign="top">I absolutely loved this picture -- it was in fact the only picture out of the 200+ I rated that got a "9" from me. I don''t understand the rating criteria on this site, I would easily put this above the #1 and #2 pictures, (although I must say I love #3). In any case, you should be proud of your shot, it meets the challenge criteria precisely and is both excellently composed and executed. Respect.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-08-11 02:19:56.</i></td>', 'I absolutely loved this picture -- it was in fact the only picture out of the 200+ I rated that got a "9" from me. I don''t understand the rating criteria on this site, I would easily put this above the #1 and #2 pictures, (although I must say I love #3). In any case, you should be proud of your shot, it meets the challenge criteria precisely and is both excellently composed and executed. Respect.', '2004-08-11 03:19:01.000000', '2004-08-11 03:19:56.000000', 0),
(853886, 94351, 15407, '<td valign="top">Yep! ... Another example of why I added you to my favorites! Congratulations again! How about a West coast vacation ? I''ll put you up in the slums of Marin for a few days and follow you around hoping to garner some knowledge about tuning the ''photographers eye'' !<br/>Tim</td>', 'Yep! ... Another example of why I added you to my favorites! Congratulations again! How about a West coast vacation ? I''ll put you up in the slums of Marin for a few days and follow you around hoping to garner some knowledge about tuning the ''photographers eye'' !Tim', '2004-08-11 03:40:42.000000', NULL, 0),
