(854147, 95692, 24764, '<td valign="top">Very imaginative shot. Wonderful landscape. A little bit of the sky would have added a lot of depth to this picture. The sky looks really nice in the background and by showing a little bit of the mountain to the left it would have been great.</td>', 'Very imaginative shot. Wonderful landscape. A little bit of the sky would have added a lot of depth to this picture. The sky looks really nice in the background and by showing a little bit of the mountain to the left it would have been great.', '2004-08-11 06:37:57.000000', NULL, 0),
