(854161, 95629, 24764, '<td valign="top">Mozart''s mini violin. The size of violin i imagine the great composer used during his youth :) Congratulations</td>', 'Mozart''s mini violin. The size of violin i imagine the great composer used during his youth :) Congratulations', '2004-08-11 06:59:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(854179, 94351, 11800, '<td valign="top">Things just haven''t been the same since you showed up. Your pictures sure show us how much fun we could have if we would let our inner child take part in this fun activity known as photography. Thanks.</td>', 'Things just haven''t been the same since you showed up. Your pictures sure show us how much fun we could have if we would let our inner child take part in this fun activity known as photography. Thanks.', '2004-08-11 07:22:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(854188, 94544, 24744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by NRRon:</b></div><hr/><i> Nicely taken, but I don''t understand the pictorial logic of associating a motercycle with a guitar. </i></td></tr></table> <br/>It is a bit strange i admit... you see i was looking around for ages for something that would look like a miniature road, and then i spotted the fretboard of my bass :)  But in the end i ended up using the body for the reflection, and to match the red.<br/> <br/>Cheers for all the helpful comments folks :)</td>', 'Originally posted by NRRon: Nicely taken, but I don''t understand the pictorial logic of associating a motercycle with a guitar.  It is a bit strange i admit... you see i was looking around for ages for something that would look like a miniature road, and then i spotted the fretboard of my bass :)  But in the end i ended up using the body for the reflection, and to match the red. Cheers for all the helpful comments folks :)', '2004-08-11 07:29:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(854194, 95700, 16148, '<td valign="top">My score is about what I would expect for this shot.  I was trying to make the chair appear to be normal size and the model miniature.  For many voters I didn''t pull this off.  I wanted to go back and take this shot again with my model in a light colored dress but didn''t have time.</td>', 'My score is about what I would expect for this shot.  I was trying to make the chair appear to be normal size and the model miniature.  For many voters I didn''t pull this off.  I wanted to go back and take this shot again with my model in a light colored dress but didn''t have time.', '2004-08-11 07:35:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(854209, 94826, 21576, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments, I would have liked to have put a golf ball in the shot, but it was a public exhibition and they don''t take too kindly to moving things around or adding things.  This was in natural light, about midday.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments, I would have liked to have put a golf ball in the shot, but it was a public exhibition and they don''t take too kindly to moving things around or adding things.  This was in natural light, about midday.', '2004-08-11 07:45:07.000000', NULL, 0),
(854221, 95525, 11410, '<td valign="top">should DEFINITELY have been a ribbon - was my favourite shot of the challenge.  congrats though on the top ten finish!</td>', 'should DEFINITELY have been a ribbon - was my favourite shot of the challenge.  congrats though on the top ten finish!', '2004-08-11 07:56:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(854304, 94351, 4482, '<td valign="top">Good one! Very funny!!  :-)</td>', 'Good one! Very funny!!  :-)', '2004-08-11 08:54:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(854337, 94708, 11467, '<td valign="top">A shame this didn''t do better. Idea was great, just too many narrow minded people here for this sort of humor.</td>', 'A shame this didn''t do better. Idea was great, just too many narrow minded people here for this sort of humor.', '2004-08-11 09:10:47.000000', NULL, 0),
