(854384, 95363, 14012, '<td valign="top">I bet if the Mustang was red and your focus was just a tad deeper, so all the car was in focus, this would have scored a point higher. As you already know, DPC voters like purty colors.<br/> <br/>Great idea though.</td>', 'I bet if the Mustang was red and your focus was just a tad deeper, so all the car was in focus, this would have scored a point higher. As you already know, DPC voters like purty colors. Great idea though.', '2004-08-11 10:02:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(854385, 95539, 9411, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by annasense:</b></div><hr/><i> you were robbed.  i gave you a 10.  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>THanks... but I expected this. Dark doesn''t do well here. I think too many people have uncalibrated monitors.  But I was pleased with the shot so I entered it. I appreciate your 10!</td>', 'Originally posted by annasense: you were robbed.  i gave you a 10.  :)   THanks... but I expected this. Dark doesn''t do well here. I think too many people have uncalibrated monitors.  But I was pleased with the shot so I entered it. I appreciate your 10!', '2004-08-11 10:03:11.000000', NULL, 0),
(854416, 94227, 14614, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all that offered their comments and voted.  Not quite sure why the tiny spoon wasn''t seen as a mini by some... Special thanks to Mambe for sharing my taste in silverware!<br/></td>', 'Thanks to all that offered their comments and voted.  Not quite sure why the tiny spoon wasn''t seen as a mini by some... Special thanks to Mambe for sharing my taste in silverware!', '2004-08-11 10:20:47.000000', NULL, 0),
(854461, 95689, 19670, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments--this was a quick shot taken just before rain actually started coming down hard. Thanks to my wife for her great expression and pose, and for helping me out with this submission.</td>', 'Thanks for the comments--this was a quick shot taken just before rain actually started coming down hard. Thanks to my wife for her great expression and pose, and for helping me out with this submission.', '2004-08-11 10:38:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(854498, 95112, 8125, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for the comments!  This was my first real attempt at a serious studio setup.  I''m happy with the results of both the shot and the challenge results.  :-)</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for the comments!  This was my first real attempt at a serious studio setup.  I''m happy with the results of both the shot and the challenge results.  :-)', '2004-08-11 10:59:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(854530, 95538, 23126, '<td valign="top">I realized soon after submitting this that a pair of keys in the photo really would have made this much better, as far as the theme anyway. It had occurred to me to shoot the whole scene in front of a car tire but that would have ruined the style of the shot. Keys wouldn''t have though. Oh well, maybe next time.<br/> <br/>Thanks for the comments</td>', 'I realized soon after submitting this that a pair of keys in the photo really would have made this much better, as far as the theme anyway. It had occurred to me to shoot the whole scene in front of a car tire but that would have ruined the style of the shot. Keys wouldn''t have though. Oh well, maybe next time. Thanks for the comments', '2004-08-11 11:25:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(854642, 94689, 24830, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments...<br/> <br/>Yes, those are drinking glasses...<br/> <br/>This was my first entry... Hopefully I''ll learn some things here... =)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments... Yes, those are drinking glasses... This was my first entry... Hopefully I''ll learn some things here... =)', '2004-08-11 12:14:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(854653, 95161, 25314, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea, reasonable composition, but the lighting is harsh and nasty. Try using natural light next time, or perhaps a lamp/flashlight and a tripod.<br/> <br/>Might''ve been nice to backlight it against a window and create sillouettes?<br/> <br/>Composition is alright, although I''d rather it was slightly further away from the birds myself.<br/> <br/>Good attempt.</td>', 'Excellent idea, reasonable composition, but the lighting is harsh and nasty. Try using natural light next time, or perhaps a lamp/flashlight and a tripod. Might''ve been nice to backlight it against a window and create sillouettes? Composition is alright, although I''d rather it was slightly further away from the birds myself. Good attempt.', '2004-08-11 12:21:43.000000', NULL, 0),
(854660, 94946, 25314, '<td valign="top">Bit squint, slightly soft, but great colour. Composition is good apart from the fact that it''s not level.<br/> <br/>Gave it a 6.</td>', 'Bit squint, slightly soft, but great colour. Composition is good apart from the fact that it''s not level. Gave it a 6.', '2004-08-11 12:24:14.000000', NULL, 0),
(854667, 95586, 25314, '<td valign="top">Very nice antique colours, good focus, but I''m a bit unsure about the composition. Just my personal opinion.<br/> <br/>Would''ve been nicer with a plain black border.<br/> <br/>Good image, not related to the challenge though. Gave it a 6, otherwise it might get an 8.</td>', 'Very nice antique colours, good focus, but I''m a bit unsure about the composition. Just my personal opinion. Would''ve been nicer with a plain black border. Good image, not related to the challenge though. Gave it a 6, otherwise it might get an 8.', '2004-08-11 12:27:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(854675, 94877, 25314, '<td valign="top">I like this one, thought it would go a bit higher. Only thing I have doubts about is the scale, but otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'I like this one, thought it would go a bit higher. Only thing I have doubts about is the scale, but otherwise, very nice.', '2004-08-11 12:30:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(854692, 94351, 25314, '<td valign="top">Excellent! I love the colours and background. The action is stopped nicely and it''s a great scene overall.<br/> <br/>Only thing I''d change myself is that I''d move around the faucet a bit to get some distance between it and the surfer, and reduce DOF to concentrate on getting only the surfer in focus.. but then you might lose the effect of the leading line, not to mention drown your camera :D<br/> <br/>Straight 10. Congrats on ribbon.</td>', 'Excellent! I love the colours and background. The action is stopped nicely and it''s a great scene overall. Only thing I''d change myself is that I''d move around the faucet a bit to get some distance between it and the surfer, and reduce DOF to concentrate on getting only the surfer in focus.. but then you might lose the effect of the leading line, not to mention drown your camera :D Straight 10. Congrats on ribbon.', '2004-08-11 12:40:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(854706, 95143, 25028, '<td valign="top">congratulations :).  keep up the good work!</td>', 'congratulations :).  keep up the good work!', '2004-08-11 12:44:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(854711, 95701, 25314, '<td valign="top">I really loved this one, it creates an interesting illusion. The lighting is lovely and the framing of the subject with the mousehole is perfect.<br/> <br/>I might''ve tried shooting lower on the floor myself, but then I wouldn''t have enough imagination to think of something as original as this in the first place!<br/> <br/>I gave it an 8, but in retrospect it deserved a 10. I never had enough time to go back and change it. :(</td>', 'I really loved this one, it creates an interesting illusion. The lighting is lovely and the framing of the subject with the mousehole is perfect. I might''ve tried shooting lower on the floor myself, but then I wouldn''t have enough imagination to think of something as original as this in the first place! I gave it an 8, but in retrospect it deserved a 10. I never had enough time to go back and change it. :(', '2004-08-11 12:45:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(854716, 95112, 25314, '<td valign="top">I thought this would go much higher. Gave it a 10. Loved the background, lighting and b&amp;w finish.</td>', 'I thought this would go much higher. Gave it a 10. Loved the background, lighting and b&w finish.', '2004-08-11 12:48:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(854723, 95598, 25314, '<td valign="top">I personally like the pink touch, makes the whole thing seem a bit more vintage. Like the inclusion of the "50mm" text in the main subject. Gave it a 10, thought it would go higher than it did!</td>', 'I personally like the pink touch, makes the whole thing seem a bit more vintage. Like the inclusion of the "50mm" text in the main subject. Gave it a 10, thought it would go higher than it did!', '2004-08-11 12:50:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(854737, 95466, 25314, '<td valign="top">I really like the glow on the background leaf, but it distracts slightly from the smaller version. It would''ve been nice to have the small leaf slightly sharper or brighter/darker to highlight it a touch more.<br/> <br/>Background leaf looks like a surreal landscape with a forked road. I want to dive in and go exploring :).<br/> <br/>Gave it an 8, probably deserved a 9 in retrospect.<br/></td>', 'I really like the glow on the background leaf, but it distracts slightly from the smaller version. It would''ve been nice to have the small leaf slightly sharper or brighter/darker to highlight it a touch more. Background leaf looks like a surreal landscape with a forked road. I want to dive in and go exploring :). Gave it an 8, probably deserved a 9 in retrospect.', '2004-08-11 12:57:26.000000', NULL, 0),
