(856169, 95611, 11800, '<td valign="top">I thought this showed a great amount of imagination. And I think it fit the challenge wonderfully. The bus(?) was the miniature, the bees were the comparison. I would have given it a higher score than 5 if the bee on the right wasn''t on it''s side. Well, both of them I quess.<br/>Keep up the good work and pay attention to the little details and you''ll have a winner one of these days.</td>', 'I thought this showed a great amount of imagination. And I think it fit the challenge wonderfully. The bus(?) was the miniature, the bees were the comparison. I would have given it a higher score than 5 if the bee on the right wasn''t on it''s side. Well, both of them I quess.Keep up the good work and pay attention to the little details and you''ll have a winner one of these days.', '2004-08-11 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(856273, 94736, 19035, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jenesis:</b></div><hr/><i> Hmph!!  So what do I know.... I was gonna ask you if I could have your car, come to find out it''s a model of model....  :-)  I think you deserved better.  It''s a great shot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for you wonderful comments, 22 comments in total, really impressed me - the votes were great too, one of these days I''ll figure out who keeps voting my better pics 1''s and 2''s, oh well, cant dwell on the negative, I was very pleased with the outcome and thanks again everybody.</td>', 'Originally posted by jenesis: Hmph!!  So what do I know.... I was gonna ask you if I could have your car, come to find out it''s a model of model....  :-)  I think you deserved better.  It''s a great shot!   Thank you for you wonderful comments, 22 comments in total, really impressed me - the votes were great too, one of these days I''ll figure out who keeps voting my better pics 1''s and 2''s, oh well, cant dwell on the negative, I was very pleased with the outcome and thanks again everybody.', '2004-08-12 00:04:01.000000', NULL, 0),
(856359, 94351, 14386, '<td valign="top">Wow...wow Daniel. You are on a roll. I am very happy for you. But you deserve this absolutely. Such great imagination and wonderful execution. Your shots are unpreditable. This one seems to be a work of a late 20 early 30 photographer. So cool concept!<br/> <br/>CONGRATULATIONS.<br/> <br/>Manny</td>', 'Wow...wow Daniel. You are on a roll. I am very happy for you. But you deserve this absolutely. Such great imagination and wonderful execution. Your shots are unpreditable. This one seems to be a work of a late 20 early 30 photographer. So cool concept! CONGRATULATIONS. Manny', '2004-08-12 01:03:01.000000', NULL, 0),
