(1713885, 94596, 34659, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big cat fan myself, but this shot really has a very special quality about it.  The muted tones and unique lighting all work very well IMHO to bring the opposing subjects together.  I do agree that a little bounced lighting on the cat might help shed some light on him/her (pun intended), and that a little camera around his/her neck would be cute, but I really like the shot as is.  Very creative and unusual.</td>', 'I''m not a big cat fan myself, but this shot really has a very special quality about it.  The muted tones and unique lighting all work very well IMHO to bring the opposing subjects together.  I do agree that a little bounced lighting on the cat might help shed some light on him/her (pun intended), and that a little camera around his/her neck would be cute, but I really like the shot as is.  Very creative and unusual.', '2005-09-16 11:45:22.000000', NULL, 0),
